  "details": "Couldn't find an in-depth post regarding this, so I thought I'd make my own. Calibration for FBT can be a struggle for different people due to a multitude of reasons. Some people might have disabilities preventing them from standing up or standing straight, others might be in a living situation that doesn't allow them to stand properly. Having different calibration poses for sitting, laying, etc. would help  with FBT's accessibility. \n\n(let the van life homies use fbt too lol)",
